From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minimal <minimal@localhost>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:02:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] minimal: lightweight simulator (owner ruling 2026-10-25)

No experiment tracking (result writers move to utils/results, the logger to utils/pylogger,
the in-process policy recorder to utils/policy/state_recorder), no ZenML, policy tags,
vectorized policies, route improvement, acceptance-criteria package, time constraints, time
windows, HRL manager, GUI stream, failure analysis or Thompson rewards. Training builds the
plain Attention Model with REINFORCE and no mandatory selector. Only modules that ship are
edited.
